EInvoiceM365Help = <b>Microsoft 365 setup</b><br>1. Entra ID → App registrations → New registration (this directory only).<br>2. Certificates &amp; secrets → New client secret; note the value.<br>3a. <b>Graph:</b> restrict access to the invoice mailbox with Exchange Online PowerShell (RBAC for Applications, role "Application Mail.ReadWrite"). Do not grant a Graph permission in Entra, it would apply to all mailboxes.<br>3b. <b>IMAP:</b> API permission "Office 365 Exchange Online → IMAP.AccessAsApp" (application) + admin consent, then in Exchange Online <code>New-ServicePrincipal</code> and <code>Add-MailboxPermission -AccessRights FullAccess</code> for the invoice mailbox only.

